<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 2-yr inflation-indexed bond auction.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 2-yr inflation-indexed bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday two-year, inflation indexed, three-month coupon payment bonds after it sold 198.1 trillion lira worth two-year bonds on June 3.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : June 18, 1999</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: June 17 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : June 18,1997</p>
<p>The central bank has 43.4 trillion lira repayments on the open market operations on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
